    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef my_ranks(values):\n    ordered = sorted(values)\n    return [ordered.index(v) + 1 for v in values]\n\n\nprint(my_ranks([42, 900, 55, 61]))\nprint(my_ranks([3.5, 1.2, 9.9]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef my_ranks(values):\n    ordered = sorted(values)\n    return [ordered.index(v) + 1 for v in values]\n\n\nprint(my_ranks([42, 900, 55, 61]))\nprint(my_ranks([3.5, 1.2, 9.9]))\n```"
    }
